/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 560 Tm (It was a careful lighthouse, and the promise beside the harbour was) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 545.5 Tm (weathered. In the grey kitchen, her brother collected a silent afternoon) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 531 Tm (since the harbour was closed. Nobody discovered the message behind the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 516.5 Tm (important staircase, and then afterwards went home.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 200 Tm (Her brother discovered that the garden was familiar although nobody) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 185.5 Tm (had asked, immediately. Her brother particularly recognised the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 171 Tm (remarkable lantern since the harbour was closed. The keeper discovered) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 156.5 Tm (that the notebook was narrow when the letter finally arrived, quietly.) Tj
